{"translator":"用户提供汉化包（原译者未注明）","rows":[{"id":"user-3","name":"学生","text":"──あれ、のぼらない？","trans":"——咦，你不上去吗？","sourceId":"user-enza-fix-2026-11-13","exactOnly":true},{"id":"3020022020010","name":"透","text":"……\r\n……こわい","trans":"……\n……害怕","sourceId":"user-enza-fix-2026-11-13","exactOnly":true},{"id":"3020022020020","name":"透","text":"……つづいてて\r\nどこまでも","trans":"……还在继续\n无论到哪里","sourceId":"user-enza-fix-2026-11-13","exactOnly":true},{"id":"user-7","name":"学生","text":"そっか──……無理にとは言わないけど\r\nでも、興味があるならさ","trans":"这样啊——……我不是要勉强你\n不过，如果你有兴趣的话","sourceId":"user-enza-fix-2026-11-13","exactOnly":true},{"id":"user-9","name":"学生","text":"今日は俺も一緒にのぼれるし！\r\n……どう？","trans":"今天我也能陪你一起爬！\n……怎么样？","sourceId":"user-enza-fix-2026-11-13","exactOnly":true},{"id":"3020022020040","name":"透","text":"……うん\r\n行く、僕も","trans":"……嗯\n我去，我也去","sourceId":"user-enza-fix-2026-11-13","exactOnly":true},{"id":"user-15","name":"学生","text":"よし\r\nじゃあ、しっかり両手で掴んで……足を掛けて","trans":"好\n那就用双手好好抓住……脚踩上去","sourceId":"user-enza-fix-2026-11-13","exactOnly":true},{"id":"3020022020050","name":"透","text":"──っしょ……っと……わっ","trans":"——嘿咻……嘿……哇","sourceId":"user-enza-fix-2026-11-13","exactOnly":true},{"id":"3020022020060","name":"透","text":"うん……\r\n──……よ……","trans":"嗯……\n——……好……","sourceId":"user-enza-fix-2026-11-13","exactOnly":true},{"id":"user-20","name":"学生","text":"──よいしょ……！","trans":"——嘿咻……！","sourceId":"user-enza-fix-2026-11-13","exactOnly":true},{"id":"3020022020070","name":"透","text":"──\r\n待って……！","trans":"——\n等等……！","sourceId":"user-enza-fix-2026-11-13","exactOnly":true},{"id":"3020022020080","name":"off","text":"着かなかったら\r\nどうしよう","trans":"要是到不了\n怎么办呢","sourceId":"user-enza-fix-2026-11-13","exactOnly":true},{"id":"3020022020090","name":"透","text":"────……っしょ\r\n────……と……","trans":"————……嘿咻\n————……嘿……","sourceId":"user-enza-fix-2026-11-13","exactOnly":true},{"id":"3020022020100","name":"off","text":"──おわらなかったら","trans":"——要是没有尽头","sourceId":"user-enza-fix-2026-11-13","exactOnly":true},{"id":"3020022020110","name":"透","text":"……のぼ、れた……？","trans":"……爬上，来了……？","sourceId":"user-enza-fix-2026-11-13","exactOnly":true},{"id":"user-37","name":"学生","text":"──うん\r\nのぼれたんだよ","trans":"——嗯\n你爬上来了","sourceId":"user-enza-fix-2026-11-13","exactOnly":true},{"id":"3020022020140","name":"透","text":"……\r\nそっか……──！","trans":"……\n这样啊……——！","sourceId":"user-enza-fix-2026-11-13","exactOnly":true},{"id":"3020022020150","name":"透","text":"──ねぇ\r\nどこから来たの？","trans":"——呐\n你是从哪里来的？","sourceId":"user-enza-fix-2026-11-13","exactOnly":true},{"id":"user-47","name":"学生","text":"俺か？\r\n……少し遠くかな","trans":"我吗？\n……有点远吧","sourceId":"user-enza-fix-2026-11-13","exactOnly":true},{"id":"3020022020180","name":"off","text":"────遠く","trans":"————很远","sourceId":"user-enza-fix-2026-11-13","exactOnly":true},{"id":"user-57","name":"透の母","text":"おかえりー、遅かったね\r\nどこかに寄ってた？","trans":"欢迎回来——，回来得挺晚呢\n在哪儿绕了一圈？","sourceId":"user-enza-fix-2026-11-13","exactOnly":true},{"id":"3020022020190","name":"透","text":"……公園","trans":"……公园","sourceId":"user-enza-fix-2026-11-13","exactOnly":true},{"id":"user-59","name":"透の母","text":"そうなんだ\r\nおやつあるけど食べる？","trans":"这样啊\n有零食，要吃吗？","sourceId":"user-enza-fix-2026-11-13","exactOnly":true},{"id":"3020022020200","name":"透","text":"うん","trans":"嗯","sourceId":"user-enza-fix-2026-11-13","exactOnly":true},{"id":"user-62","name":"透の母","text":"おばさんのお土産よ\r\n今日も寄ってくれてね","trans":"是阿姨带的特产哦\n今天也来家里坐了坐","sourceId":"user-enza-fix-2026-11-13","exactOnly":true},{"id":"user-63","name":"透の母","text":"さっきまでここにいたんだけど\r\nタイムセールがあるからって慌てて帰ったところ","trans":"刚才还在这儿的\n说是有限时特卖，急急忙忙回去了","sourceId":"user-enza-fix-2026-11-13","exactOnly":true},{"id":"user-65","name":"透の母","text":"──公園は楽しかった？\r\n何か、変わったことあった？","trans":"——公园好玩吗？\n有没有什么不一样的事？","sourceId":"user-enza-fix-2026-11-13","exactOnly":true},{"id":"3020022020220","name":"off","text":"あったのかも","trans":"也许是有的","sourceId":"user-enza-fix-2026-11-13","exactOnly":true},{"id":"user-83","name":"子どもの母親","text":"君、最近よくこの公園に来てるね\r\n今日もひとり？","trans":"你最近经常来这个公园呢\n今天也是一个人？","sourceId":"user-enza-fix-2026-11-13","exactOnly":true},{"id":"3020022020260","name":"雛菜","text":"──それでね、\r\nえきの近くにペットショップができたんだって～","trans":"——然后呢，\n听说车站附近开了家宠物店～","sourceId":"user-enza-fix-2026-11-13","exactOnly":true},{"id":"3020022020270","name":"小糸","text":"そ、そうなんだ……ペットショップ……\r\nどうぶつ、たくさんいるのかな……","trans":"是，是这样啊……宠物店……\n会不会有很多动物呢……","sourceId":"user-enza-fix-2026-11-13","exactOnly":true},{"id":"3020022020280","name":"円香","text":"……少しのぞくくらいならいいんじゃない？","trans":"……只是稍微看一眼的话，不是挺好吗？","sourceId":"user-enza-fix-2026-11-13","exactOnly":true},{"id":"3020022020290","name":"小糸","text":"えっと……\r\nとおるちゃんは、公園、行きたい……？","trans":"那个……\n透你想去公园吗……？","sourceId":"user-enza-fix-2026-11-13","exactOnly":true},{"id":"3020022020300","name":"透","text":"え？","trans":"诶？","sourceId":"user-enza-fix-2026-11-13","exactOnly":true},{"id":"3020022020310","name":"雛菜","text":"さっきから、ずっと公園のほう見てる～","trans":"从刚才开始，就一直看着公园那边～","sourceId":"user-enza-fix-2026-11-13","exactOnly":true},{"id":"3020022020330","name":"off","text":"遠い──────","trans":"很远——————","sourceId":"user-enza-fix-2026-11-13","exactOnly":true},{"id":"3020022020340","name":"透","text":"……ううん\r\nいい","trans":"……没有\n不用了","sourceId":"user-enza-fix-2026-11-13","exactOnly":true},{"id":"3020022020350","name":"透","text":"行こ\r\nペットショップ","trans":"走吧\n宠物店","sourceId":"user-enza-fix-2026-11-13","exactOnly":true}],"additionalSources":[{"id":"user-enza-fix-2026-11-13","package":"enza-player-app-fix.zip","dictionary":"data/translations/zh_dynamic.json","sha256":"63c8feb976e689fa7d5b8d21e48ce143c9f462fdaa8a2d1c3367e9c7fccefd98","credit":"用户提供汉化包（原译者未注明）"}]}